      729        LABEL "Сумма"
      730         VIEW-AS TEXT
      731        SIZE 14 BY .67 NO-UNDO.
      732   DEFINE VARIABLE v-date AS DATE FORMAT "99/99/9999":U
      733        LABEL "Дата чека"
